  "bio": "Paul Talbot, based in Bromsgrove, United Kingdom, is a highly skilled tattoo artist who specializes in 'trashpolka' style tattoos. His work, shrouded in a delightful riddle of design and mystery, is showcased at Modern Electric Tattoo and extensively covered in his column for Total Tattoo. His particular talent is in blending chaos and order to create unique and powerful images that has established him as a key contributor in the local tattoo scene.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Bromsgrove, England, United Kingdom"
